//!
//! Generated from Lightroom Classic 15.6 renders of a synthetic chart carrying the CC0 iPhone 12
//! Pro ProRAW's colour tags with its `ProfileToneCurve` replaced by an identity curve, so the
//! renders show Lightroom's own operators (grey ramp, 48 patches; the green-clipped top patch
//! left out). Do not edit by hand.
